          "pdf_pages": [
            181
          ]
        },
        "description": "Control electricity through five distinct applications: electrical resistance, an S.D.C. discharge, an M.D. blast, device controls, and sensing electricity. Resistance ignores up to 60000 volts and halves greater, lightning, and magic electricity. Discharge causes a jolt or up to 1D6 S.D.C.; a blast inflicts 1D6, 2D6, or 3D6 M.D. Device manipulation permits twelve electrical functions per melee without seeing the device. Sense Electricity starts at 55% and gains 5% per additional level; failure senses only 1D6x10% of sources.",
